[gd_resource type="Resource" script_class="CasChapterSceneVisual" load_steps=50 format=3]

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://scripts/chapter_scene_resource.gd" id="1_scene"]

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://scripts/chapter_line_resource.gd" id="2_line"]

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_0"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="从主档案库撤到外侧的临时抄录点后，你们才放下封好的匣子。这间旧工房比库房小得多，最亮的地方是一张磨花了的玻璃桌。拉姆森装上扫描灯的干电池，敲了一下才亮，又装作自己没敲过。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "perkins", "tideborn"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_1"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="lamson"

speaker_name=""

text="只准这一次。接下来谁碰它都先问我，里面的焊点松了。我不是在护着破东西，是不想抄到一半整份重来。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "perkins", "tideborn"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_2"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="perkins"

speaker_name=""

text="先分任务。原件不许写，页边有不认识的字也别猜着补。你读一遍，我对另一份；潮痕核设备编号，德雷顿查人员记录。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "perkins", "tideborn"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_3"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="读不出来的地方怎么处理？这里像个名字，也可能只是写到一半的零件号。我怕抄错以后，回去查到一个完全无关的人。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "perkins", "tideborn"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_4"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="perkins"

speaker_name=""

text="留空，拍照，写清页码。查不到比查错好，至少别人知道应该回来找哪一处。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "perkins", "tideborn"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_5"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="第一份记录的时间比第二份早了十一分钟，可写的明明是同一次检查。你以为其中一份被改过，潮痕却让你先看纸上提到的挂钟。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "perkins", "tideborn"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_6"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="tideborn"

speaker_name=""

text="值班室的钟每次断电都会停。后来有人手动拨过，没有对准。用它记录的时间，会一直比公共广播慢。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "perkins", "tideborn"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_7"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="所以相差十一分钟，不足以证明有人提前知道结果。得先找到这两只钟有没有同时正常走过。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "perkins", "tideborn"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_8"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="你们把几页餐食领用单排在旁边。送饭的人同时经过两间房，记下的签收时间正好能接起来。那些原本像边角料的纸，把差出来的十一分钟填上了。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "perkins", "tideborn"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_9"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="这儿有个名字被划掉，又在下一行写回来。我开始以为是名单反复。现在看备注，是她那天换了值班，不是人没了又回来。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "perkins", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_10"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="lamson"

speaker_name=""

text="那你别念刚才那种语气了。我还以为这里有谁能从名单上爬回来，差点把灯按灭。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "perkins", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_11"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="德雷顿把纸往她那边推，让她自己看。拉姆森凑过去时还在笑，看清另一处小字以后，却把后半句话咽了回去。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "perkins", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_12"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="lamson"

speaker_name=""

text="这一栏是真的没回来。旁边的人替她领过一次饭，后来没再领。连这也有记录。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "perkins", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_13"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="我们要把名字全部抄进公开材料吗？如果她还有家人在港口，不能让人从一张贴出来的纸上，第一次知道这个。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "perkins", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_14"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="sanfrancisco"

speaker_name=""

text="先分别封存。涉及设备停机的部分可以先核查，人员去向另建名册。回去以后找得到家属，就让他们先看，不用从公告栏上猜。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["sanfrancisco", "perkins", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_15"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="旧金山那边传来翻纸声。她问你们是不是缺人手，又问扫描灯还亮不亮。帕金斯只回答第二个问题，说亮着，正在对下一页。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["sanfrancisco", "perkins", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_16"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="perkins"

speaker_name=""

text="我们现在多一双手，也不见得能快。哪些地方已经核过，只有在这里的人清楚。等副本出去，需要人做另一轮独立核对，那时再安排。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["sanfrancisco", "perkins", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_17"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="你翻到一份报修申请。申请人说储存区不能继续加人，冷却不够，下面连续盖了三枚“待处理”。第四枚章旁边，有人把“待”改成了“已”。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["sanfrancisco", "perkins", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_18"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="这份可以说明有人把未处理写成处理完了。但不知道是谁动的笔。传讯者知道这件事吗？他在频道里一直说所有准备都齐了。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["sanfrancisco", "perkins", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_19"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="tideborn"

speaker_name=""

text="他来得比这份记录晚。我不知道谁把整套东西交给他，也不知道有没有人让他看过下面这些报修。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["tideborn", "perkins", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_20"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="perkins"

speaker_name=""

text="那就别写他亲手改了。我们查他现在做什么，不需要先把以前所有的错都塞进一个人的名字里。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["tideborn", "perkins", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_21"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="你把那枚不完整的章放大，发现下面露出一小截旧日期。主档案里被归为同一批的几张纸，其实隔着很长的时间，连纸张边缘的水痕都不同。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["tideborn", "perkins", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_22"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="它把不同时候的人排成了一排。看起来像同一天，所有人都作出了同样的选择。可他们根本没有在同一间房里待过。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["tideborn", "perkins", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_23"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="难怪前面有人写药不够，后面又说物资充足。不是谁在撒同一句谎，是编的时候把中间的日子省掉了。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["tideborn", "perkins", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_24"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="拉姆森调暗扫描灯，省下最后一段电。桌面上的字没那么清楚了，你们便靠近一些，一句句念，听见不对的地方就停下来重对。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["tideborn", "perkins", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_25"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="fletcher"

speaker_name=""

text="还差多少？外面的水位在变。不是催你们快，是我们得决定剩下的时间拿去抄，还是留给送出去的人。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["fletcher", "perkins", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_26"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="perkins"

speaker_name=""

text="原件封好了。现在这份缺两个索引，内容够第二组复核，但不能只送一个人。一路上必须有人替她看接近的东西。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["fletcher", "perkins", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_27"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="我跟着走。这里的分组和页码我经手过，到那边如果发现错位，至少能说清自己是在哪一步弄错的。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["fletcher", "perkins", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_28"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="德雷顿用胶带在你的防水袋上贴了一道斜线，说原件是直线，副本是斜线。她怕写字在雨里看不见，便又在斜线旁边剪掉一个小角。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["fletcher", "perkins", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_29"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="回来以后你可以嫌我难看。现在摸一下袋口。闭着眼也能分出来，到了外面就不用把每一层都拆开看。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["fletcher", "perkins", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_30"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="你照她说的摸了一遍。帕金斯把另一只副本袋交给拉姆森，两人分别报了装袋的页数。门外水声很急，弗莱彻先出去看，你们留在桌边，把借来的工具逐件收回包里。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["fletcher", "perkins", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_31"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="搬运之前，读取器突然发出很短的一声鸣响。拉姆森抬手让大家别碰，先看电压。屏幕没有熄，却在角落跳出一行已经发黄的设备提示。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["fletcher", "perkins", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_32"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="lamson"

speaker_name=""

text="电池没坏。它在找另一个储存盒。编号在右下角，谁帮我照一下？这块玻璃斜着看才不反光。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["fletcher", "perkins", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_33"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="末两位是四和七。前面那一位像零，但也可能是字母。要是照错了，是不是会把别的盒子接进去？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["fletcher", "perkins", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_34"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="perkins"

speaker_name=""

text="我们不靠输编号把它找出来。先把提示拍下，查柜里的实物。没有对应的，就带回去慢慢查，别让一个催着闪的框替咱们定下一步。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["fletcher", "perkins", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_35"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="潮痕认出柜门边的标记，里面存的是未寄出的信件。帕金斯问她为什么放在这里，她说旧系统把能读出的文字和设备记录放在一起，不在乎文字原来写给谁。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["fletcher", "perkins", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_36"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="tideborn"

speaker_name=""

text="有人只想给家里留两句话，不知道会存在哪里。后来许多人以为，能在这里找到他们的信，就也能从这里找到整个人。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["fletcher", "tideborn", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_37"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="那些信还需要带走。可是不能为了找一个盒子，把现在封好的原件全部拆开。能记清柜子的位置，换下一组回来查吗？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["fletcher", "tideborn", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_38"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="fletcher"

speaker_name=""

text="可以。前提是这一带还能安全接近。我们先把门和外部接线拍全，返港以后安排，不让同一组人一直在这儿耗到撑不住。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["fletcher", "tideborn", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_39"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="德雷顿在柜门上找到一张手绘的小鸟。画得很笨，嘴比尾巴大，下面写着“取件时别把贴纸撕掉”。她盯了一会儿，忽然把那张纸也拍了下来。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["fletcher", "tideborn", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_40"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="有人认这个图。可能不认识盒子的编号，但认得自己画过的鸟。公开目录可以贴图，别直接把整封信摊出来。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "tideborn", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_41"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="lamson"

speaker_name=""

text="这下得多做一份说明，免得来领的人都画只鸟就算。你还记不记得医务室那种，看着像鸡，也有人说是鱼？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "tideborn", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_42"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="记得。我到现在也没问清。这张要是也分不清，就先让画的人说，咱们别靠猜它是什么去找人。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

