[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_43"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="你们没有打开柜子。拉姆森量了门框，确认回来的搬运工具能不能经过；帕金斯记下编号，德雷顿把贴纸的照片单独存好。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "tideborn", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_44"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="perkins"

speaker_name=""

text="我把这一项写成“定位，未提取”。现在要先把送到抄录点的这份核完，再回库里取另一份。回去有人问为什么没一次拿全，就把时间和载荷一起给他看。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "tideborn", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_45"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="好。也别写“遗憾未能”。那听起来像已经过去了。我们知道它在哪里，后面该让谁来处理，这件事还没结束。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "tideborn", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_46"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="弗莱彻等你写完，让送件的小艇先靠稳。你们把已经核过的箱子交给接班的人，只带空袋和工具，沿刚走过的航路重新回库。信件柜的位置留在抄录点的登记纸上，第二次取件不必从头找。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

